{"id":"vod_bf_43395","vodId":"43395","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"游魂 -Kiss on my Deity-","name_cn":"游魂 -Kiss on my Deity-","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/e75484ff8cf37262d79280e65e82c8dc.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为创圣学院的学校之中，这个学校被分为男校和女校两个学部，女学部的秉性的是严肃的传统名门院校的学风，而男学部则崇尚开化和革新。泉户裕理（日野聪 配音）就是在男学部就读的一名普通学生，与此同时，他的父亲是八衢神社宫的主人。　　一天，正在进行装修的学校操场地下挖出了一处刻有奇异文字的遗迹，虽然校方认为这并不是什么具有考古价值的遗迹，打算继续施工，但裕理却发现了其中的古怪。入夜，裕理偷偷的潜入校内，在遗迹处作法，很快，一个灵体便出现在了裕理的面前，裕理给这个拥有着狐狸耳朵和尾巴的女孩取名为真白（力丸乃梨子 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:09:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youhunKissonmyDeity/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:12.917Z"}